'''Goldenrod City''' features the Radio Tower and the Train Station connecting to [[Saffron City]] in Kanto.

Connects to [[Route 35]] to the North and [[Route 34]] to the South.

This city contains Goldenrod City's Gym, but will be opened only after the player becomes the Champion of Kanto.

