== Points of Interest==
===Eusine===
Tamer Eusine can be found in the underground tunnel and will attempt to swindle the player by trading a {{PokeIcon|52|132}} Meowto for the Pokémon in the first position of the player's party. He can be found later in either [[Azalea Town]] or the east side of the city where he will return the Pokémon.

===Radio Tower===
====Lottery====
Every day, the receptionist hosts a lottery and the player wins if one of their Pokemon's Trainer ID number matches the daily draw number. Matches are checked sequentially from the last digit. All of the player's Pokémon's Trainer IDs are checked (both party and boxes). If more than 1 digit match, the Great Ball will be earned in addition to the higher prize tier.

